{"id": "tea:siddhantarahasya:1", "source": "src:siddhantarahasya", "location": {"ref": "1"}, "paraphrase": "What was spoken directly by the Lord at midnight on the eleventh day of the bright fortnight of Śrāvaṇa is now told word for word.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "divine", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["teacher-transmission", "powers-experiences"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "original": {"text": "śrāvaṇasyāmale pakṣe ekādaśyāṃ mahāniśi | sākṣād bhagavatā proktaṃ tad akṣaraśa ucyate ||", "script": "IAST", "edition": "recalled from the standard text (skeleton); verify in Phase D", "licence": "public domain (pre-modern text)"}, "teachers": ["tch:vallabha"], "speaker": "Vallabha", "concepts": ["cpt:brahmasambandha"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:siddhantarahasya:2-3", "source": "src:siddhantarahasya", "location": {"ref": "2-3"}, "paraphrase": "By making the relation with Brahman (brahmasambandha), all faults of body and soul are removed. The faults are of five kinds: innate, arising from place and time, those determined by worldly and Vedic rule, those from association and those from contact; none of them should be thought to remain.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "divine", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion", "ritual"], "stage": "beginner", "stage_native": "brahmasambandha (initiation)"}, "types": ["teacher-transmission", "karma-liberation"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "teachers": ["tch:vallabha"], "concepts": ["cpt:brahmasambandha"], "terms": ["trm:brahmasambandha"], "obstacles": ["obs:pancavidha-dosa"], "practices": ["prc:brahmasambandha-diksa"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:siddhantarahasya:4-8", "source": "src:siddhantarahasya", "location": {"ref": "4-8"}, "paraphrase": "Therefore what has not been offered is to be avoided; those who have dedicated themselves should do everything only after offering it, as a gift already given is not given again; like the Gaṅgā purifying what enters it, offering to the Lord removes faults.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "ritual", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion", "ritual"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["practice", "ethics"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "teachers": ["tch:vallabha"], "practices": ["prc:samarpana"], "terms": ["trm:samarpana"], "notes": "Verse range approximate.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
